            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Co dzieje się w tym kodzie?</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" waggingTail = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /></content></code><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\">Definiujemy klasę</item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\">Tworzymy instancję klasy</item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Definiujemy klasę.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Question 4",
            "id": 127479,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Jaki jest prawidłowy sposób uzyskania dostępu do zmiennej instancji w języku Swift?</p><selection iscode=\"false\" multiple=\"multiple\"><item value=\"1\" correct=\"true\"><code>instance.variable</code></item><item value=\"2\" correct=\"false\"><code>instance[variable]</code></item></selection><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>instance.variable</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 1",
            "id": 127480,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>W instrukcji <code>print()</code> wyświetl zmienną <code>waggingTail</code> instancji <code>spot</code>.</p><code name=\"main.swift\" version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" waggingTail = \" /><text value=\"true\" class=\"literal\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" spot = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(spot.waggingTail)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"(\" /></content></option><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\")\" /></content></option><option startIndex=\"76\" endIndex=\"80\" /><option startIndex=\"80\" endIndex=\"81\" /><option startIndex=\"81\" endIndex=\"92\" /></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"true\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>spot</code>, następnie <code>.</code> i na końcu <code>waggingTail</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 2",
            "id": 127481,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Utwórz instancję klasy <code>Pokemon</code> i zapisz ją w zmiennej o nazwie <code>pokemon</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;Squirtle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pokemon = \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(pokemon.name)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"47\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"57\" endIndex=\"64\" /><option startIndex=\"64\" endIndex=\"66\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"[]\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"Squirtle\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>pokemon</code>, następnie <code>Pokemon</code> i na końcu <code>()</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 3",
            "id": 127482,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Wyświetl kolor instancji klasy <code>rocky</code>.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" color = \" /><text value=\"&quot;brown&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" rocky = \" /><text value=\"VirtualPet\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(rocky.color)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"validatedInput\" isDefault=\"true\" startIndex=\"79\" endIndex=\"85\" /></interactions><output><content><text value=\"brown\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wpisz <code>.color</code>.</p></body></html>"
          },
          {
            "title": "Example 4",
            "id": 127483,
            "contentType": "interactive",
            "images": [],
            "interactiveContent": "<!DOCTYPE html ><html><body><p>Dodaj zmienną o nazwie <code>weight</code> do definicji klasy i ustaw <code>\"19.8\"</code> jako jej wartość.</p><code version=\"2\" codelang=\"swift\" name=\"main.swift\" visible-if=\"always\"><content><text value=\"class\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"title\" /><text value=\" \" /><text value=\"{\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" name = \" /><text value=\"&quot;squirtle&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"  \" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" weight = \" /><text value=\"&quot;19.8&quot;\" class=\"string\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"}\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"let\" class=\"keyword\" /><text value=\" pokemon = \" /><text value=\"Pokemon\" class=\"type\" /><text value=\"()\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(pokemon.name)\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"print\" class=\"built_in\" /><text value=\"(pokemon.weight)\" /></content><interactions><interaction type=\"fillTheGap\" isDefault=\"true\"><options><option startIndex=\"42\" endIndex=\"52\" /><option startIndex=\"53\" endIndex=\"54\" /><option startIndex=\"55\" endIndex=\"61\" /><option correct=\"false\"><content><text value=\"==\" /></content></option></options></interaction></interactions><output><content><text value=\"squirtle\" /><text type=\"break\" /><text value=\"19.8\" /></content></output></code><p visible-if=\"wrong\">Koniecznie wybierz <code>let weight</code>, następnie <code>=</code> i na końcu <code>\"19.8\"</code>.</p></body></html>"
